# The build context is a whitelist (plan item 72): the files the image is built from and nothing
# else. Docs, tests, tools and the art originals under them, env files, local data and .git never
# reach the Docker daemon, whatever else lies in the checkout. tests/test_image.py checks it.
*
!LICENSE
!THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!apps/api/frx
!apps/engine
!apps/play-web
!content

# Inside those: nothing installed, built, cached, local or original.
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.map
**/raw
apps/play-web/dist
apps/play-web/dist-*
apps/play-web/tests

# Kept in the repository, not served: the asset ledger (a record of where each picture came
# from) and the parts library's own viewer page and script (the interface has its own port).
apps/play-web/assets/ledger.json
apps/play-web/assets/portrait-kit/index.html
apps/play-web/assets/portrait-kit/kit.js
